lie","price":10000,"priceFrom":true,"durationMinutes":480,"resources":["box-1"]},{"key":"ppf-strecha","name":"PPF fólie: střecha","description":"Ochranná PPF fólie. Velikost vozu S 8 000 Kč, M 10 000 Kč, XL 10 000 Kč.","category":"PPF fólie","price":8000,"priceFrom":true,"durationMinutes":480,"resources":["box-1"]},{"key":"ppf-predni-naraznik","name":"PPF fólie: přední nárazník","description":"Ochranná PPF fólie. Velikost vozu S 9 000 Kč, M 10 000 Kč, XL 11 000 Kč.","category":"PPF fólie","price":9000,"priceFrom":true,"durationMinutes":480,"resources":["box-1"]},{"key":"ppf-zadni-naraznik","name":"PPF fólie: zadní nárazník","description":"Ochranná PPF fólie. Velikost vozu S 8 000 Kč, M 10 000 Kč, XL 11 000 Kč.","category":"PPF fólie","price":8000,"priceFrom":true,"durationMinutes":480,"resources":["box-1"]},{"key":"ppf-predni-dvere","name":"PPF fólie: přední dveře","description":"Ochranná PPF fólie. Velikost vozu S 4 000 Kč, M 5 000 Kč, XL 5 500 Kč.","category":"PPF fólie","price":4000,"priceFrom":true,"durationMinutes":240,"resources":["box-1"]},{"key":"ppf-zadni-dvere","name":"PPF fólie: zadní dveře","description":"Ochranná PPF fólie. Velikost vozu S 4 000 Kč, M 5 000 Kč, XL 5 500 Kč.","category":"PPF fólie","price":4000,"priceFrom":true,"durationMinutes":240,"resources":["box-1"]},{"key":"ppf-dvere-kufru","name":"PPF fólie: dveře kufru","description":"Ochranná PPF fólie. Velikost vozu S 4 000 Kč, M 5 000 Kč, XL 6 000 Kč.","category":"PPF fólie","price":4000,"priceFrom":true,"durationMinutes":240,"resources":["box-1"]},{"key":"ppf-predni-blatnik","name":"PPF fólie: přední blatník","description":"Ochranná PPF fólie. Velikost vozu S 5 000 Kč, M 5 500 Kč, XL 6 000 Kč.","category":"PPF fólie","price":5000,"priceFrom":true,"durationMinutes":240,"resources":["box-1"]},{"key":"ppf-zadni-blatnik","name":"PPF fólie: zadní blatník","description":"Ochranná PPF fólie. Velikost vozu S 4 000 Kč, M 5 000 Kč, XL 7 000 Kč.","category":"PPF fólie","price":4000,"priceFrom":true,"dur